      "id": 0,
      "message": "\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5471952986970267163\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F928E.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e💎\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e Telegram becoming TON’s largest validator strengthens decentralization. \u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5411197345968701560\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/E29C85.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e✅\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e It lets other major players join the validator pool without centralizing the network — with Telegram as the counterbalance.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5373001317042101552\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9388.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e📈\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e More and more TON gets locked in validation as everyone competes for \u003cb\u003e20%+ APR\u003c/b\u003e.",
